OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GF}r mich war die Motivation            
OL,4,Ghaupts{chlich PI 400 und PI 500 als    
OL,5,GZielplattform zu nutzen, da ich die    
OL,6,Gbeiden Ger{te eh hier habe.            
OL,8,GDer Rest aus der Readme auf Englisch:  
OL,10,GBMX is a bare-metal Commodore emulator 
OL,11,Gfor the Raspberry PI 4/5 family derived
OL,12,Gfrom BMC64. The current focus of this  
OL,13,Gproject is to provide a smooth user    
OL,14,Gexperience on the Raspberry Pi 400 and 
OL,15,G500. It should kinda feel like a modern
OL,16,Gbreadbin. Support for Raspberry Pi <= 3
OL,17,Gis removed and left to the original    
OL,18,GBMC64 project.                         
OL,20,GThese are the main features of BMX:    
OL,22,G* Based on VICE 3.10 (C64, C128, VIC20,
OL,23,GPlus/4 and PET machines are supported) 
